{"product_id":"red-lotus-a-rare-beauty-a-fierce-heart-a-destiny-she-must-resist","title":"Red Lotus: A Rare Beauty, a Fierce Heart, a Destiny She Must Resist","description":"\u003cp\u003eLi X'ia refuses to succumb to the fate of a concubine: beautiful and quick-witted, she desires more than to be just a painted slave. When her father orders her feet to be bound in the illegal and cruel practice of the Golden Lotus, she cleverly outwits him - Li X'ia knows her feet will be her freedom.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Pai Kit Fai\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780751538984\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 496\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748966391961,"sku":"16RC-19780751538984","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/download.jpg?v=1758896194","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/red-lotus-a-rare-beauty-a-fierce-heart-a-destiny-she-must-resist","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}